WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.500
Step 2: Connect a wallet

2
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:07.724
Open Connect wallet. Pick any wallet set to Testnet: Freighter, Albedo, xBull, LOBSTR, Scopuly and more.

3
00:00:07.724 --> 00:00:12.224
Browser-extension wallets show Installed when found. This tutorial uses Albedo, a web wallet (network=testnet).

4
00:00:12.224 --> 00:00:16.025
Albedo asks to share your public key. Approve it in the wallet.

5
00:00:16.025 --> 00:00:21.026
Connected. The app remembers your choice, and every signature is checked against the Testnet passphrase.

